| bugs = 
*Ammo packs created by Resupply contribute towards the 50 resources on ground [https://forums.warframe.com/topic/164093-update-1170-1171/ limit], therefore using this ability often can lead to desirable items disappearing quickly (most notably, [[Steel Essence]] and [[Vitus Essence]]).
*Using ability or picking up ammo from the ground as a client reloads magazine instantly, however elemental buff is applied with a delay, dependent on ping.
